Patch 02 (repro-cops): OSIL cache path hard-coded for one user.

Problem: 6 scripts use OSIL = "/workspace/local-home/.cache/minlplib/minlplib/osil/<family>%d.osil".
Fix: os.path.join(os.path.expanduser("~/.cache/minlplib/minlplib/osil"), "<family>%d.osil").
Same file on this machine; portable for other users. The files are the current
https://www.minlplib.org/osil/<name>.osil (sha256 identical, checked 2026-10-02 by the
minlplib-status track). Apply after patch 01 (it touches v_chain_checks.py and v_catmix_model.py
after patch 01's edits):  git apply 02-osil-cache-path-portable.patch

